{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Show parameters for Start-VcfEdgeAtScale\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \f1 PS C:\\Users\\Administrator>  Start-VcfEdgeAtScale -?\line
\line
NAME\line
    Start-VcfEdgeAtScale\line
\line
SYNOPSIS\line
    Automates end-to-end vSphere Supervisor edge deployment at scale in VMware Cloud Foundation 9.x.\line
\line
\line
SYNTAX\line
    Start-VcfEdgeAtScale [-AcceptBadCheckResults] [-CheckForUpdates] [[-CleanUp] <String>] [-CollectLogs]\line
    [-ComputeOnly] [[-DelayBeforeAddingNextHostSeconds] <Int32>] [[-EdgeSite] <String>] [-Force] [-Initialize]\line
    [-InitializeTemplatesOnly] [[-InfrastructureJson] <String>] [[-LogLevel] <String>] [[-RollbackOnFailure]\line
    <Nullable`1>] [-SaveHarborYaml] [[-SupervisorJson] <String>] [-ValidateOnly] [-Version] [<CommonParameters>]\line
\line
\line
DESCRIPTION\line
    Start-VcfEdgeAtScale orchestrates vSphere Supervisor cluster preparation and deployment in\line
    VMware Cloud Foundation (VCF) 9.x environments. The function handles the deployment workflow including:\line
\line
    - vCenter and ESX host connection\line
    - ESX Cluster creation and host add\line
    - Datastore creation and storage policy configuration.\line
    - Virtual Distributed Switch (VDS) setup and port group configuration\line
    - vSphere Supervisor Deployment\line
    - ArgoCD installation and configuration for GitOps workflows\line
\line
    For normal runs (not -Version or -Initialize), the environment variable VcfEdgeAtScaleRootDirectory must\line
    point at your configuration base directory. Defaults for -InfrastructureJson and -SupervisorJson join that\line
    directory with infrastructure.json and supervisor.json when you omit those parameters. Logs are written\line
    under Join-Path(VcfEdgeAtScaleRootDirectory, "Logs"). Use Start-VcfEdgeAtScale -Initialize to create or\line
    refresh the recommended layout from module Templates (new or existing base directory; use\line
    -Initialize -InitializeTemplatesOnly to refresh only ServicesYaml and Docs without changing root JSON).\line
    Use Start-VcfEdgeAtScale -CollectLogs to zip infrastructure.json, supervisor.json, Logs, and ServicesYaml for\line
    support (interactive prompts).\line
\line
\line
RELATED LINKS\line
\line
REMARKS\line
    To see the examples, type: "Get-Help Start-VcfEdgeAtScale -Examples"\line
    For more information, type: "Get-Help Start-VcfEdgeAtScale -Detailed"\line
    For technical information, type: "Get-Help Start-VcfEdgeAtScale -Full"\par}
